msgstr ""

#: admin/views/settings-tab.php:21
msgid "Load Contact Form 7 only where a form is"
msgstr ""

#: admin/views/settings-tab.php:22
msgid "Its script and stylesheet load only on pages that show a form. Cloudflare Turnstile and Google reCAPTCHA, if set up, are kept off every page without one."
msgstr ""

#: admin/views/settings-tab.php:25
msgid "Do not collect the sender’s IP address"
msgstr ""

#: admin/views/settings-tab.php:26
msgid "Contact Form 7 never sees the address. Side effects: IP rules on the Disallowed Comment Keys list stop matching, [_remote_ip] stays empty in mails, and the address is no longer part of the duplicate check."
msgstr ""

#: admin/views/settings-tab.php:29
msgid "Spam protection with a honeypot and a minimum fill time"
msgstr ""

#: admin/views/settings-tab.php:30
msgid "An invisible field that bots fill in, and a signed timestamp that catches forms sent back faster than a person could type. No request to anybody, no cookie, no JavaScript. It does not stop spam sent by hand."
msgstr ""

#: admin/views/settings-tab.php:36
msgid "Store submissions in Flamingo"
msgstr ""

#: admin/views/settings-tab.php:37
msgid "Off: messages are only mailed, and the site keeps no copy."
msgstr ""

#: admin/views/settings-tab.php:40
msgid "Store submissions recognised as spam"
msgstr ""

#: admin/views/settings-tab.php:41
msgid "Off: spam is dropped instead of kept for review."
msgstr ""

